    curl -fsSL https://viettelex.com/install.sh | bash
  * Sửa gõ dấu khi đang chọn chữ trong app GTK3 (Firefox, Chromium...).
  * Gói nhỏ hơn: viettelex-text-tools 17,5 → 5 MB.
  * ---
  * Text tools for the selection: add tones, UPPER, lower, Title Case,
    Sentence case, remove tones (viettelex-text-tools package).
  * English user interface for the settings app.
  * Vᴛ / E tray icons matching the macOS menu bar.
  * One-click self-update: About → Check for updates (polkit).
  * `viettelex` metapackage + one-line install command.
  * Fix tone marks being applied to old text while a selection is active
    in GTK3 apps (Firefox, Chromium...).
  * Smaller packages: viettelex-text-tools 17.5 → 5 MB.

